        "evidence": "Root read the complete actual local proof: the explicitly globally defined ReLU formula uses Q_delta(0)=0 and pairwise identical terms on either axis, so P(x,0)=P(0,y)=0 for every real other coordinate. This is the additional proved construction consequence consumed by F2; it is not attributed to the bounded-square wording of the quoted Statement."
